<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<body style="font-family: sans-serif;">
  <h2 style="color:#cf222e;">Air quality alert: {{ station_name }}</h2>
  <p>
    The forecast for <b>{{ pollutant }}</b> at <b>{{ station_name }}</b> now crosses the
    health threshold on <b>{{ target_date }}</b> (forecast value: {{ forecast_value }} ug/m3,
    category: {{ aqi_category }}).
  </p>
  <p>Outdoor practice is not recommended that day.</p>
  <p><a href="{{ dashboard_url }}">View the full forecast</a></p>
</body>
</html>
